{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6423983393a9d69a090a01dc87c20cb7.poster.avif?t=1757516218\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6423983393a9d69a090a01dc87c20cb7.webm?t=1757516218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volstead City is rotten and dangerous. Your brother\u2014once the top bootlegger in town\u2014was arrested in a police raid. Now it\u2019s your turn to take over. As Potbellied Racoon and his men try to seize control of the city, you\u2019ll need to dodge both the cops and the criminals while uncovering the truth behind your brother\u2019s arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your brand, grow your crops, craft your booze, and meet eccentric customers across the city. Complete their quirky missions, build relationships, and grow your underground empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/d43b5594bbf496791c0633a727dfee62.poster.avif?t=1757516218\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/d43b5594bbf496791c0633a727dfee62.webm?t=1757516218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beer to hard liquors \u2014 grow your ingredients and master the machines to craft a wide variety of drinks. Ferment, distill, barrel-age, and infuse flavors to create truly unique bottles then automate it all for maximum profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e802f8aacd85dac19779abd64118a9f8.poster.avif?t=1757516218\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e802f8aacd85dac19779abd64118a9f8.webm?t=1757516218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own label, slap it on the bottle, and let the streets of Volstead know your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/5b2de72880bbebc6c6d1d724eda7f9fa.poster.avif?t=1757516218\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/5b2de72880bbebc6c6d1d724eda7f9fa.webm?t=1757516218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three seasonal regions, drive unique vehicles, uncover neighborhoods, and meet a cast of colorful NPCs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6189cafe2219be15b441f19858682e11.poster.avif?t=1757516218\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6189cafe2219be15b441f19858682e11.webm?t=1757516218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each costumer has their own taste, backstory, and questline. Fulfill their requests, build friendships, and uncover personal missions. Some want a custom-flavored drink, others are just waiting for a kiss from a princess. Complete their quests and strengthen your bond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916860?t=1757516218","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/613ce340d944d0ade83c3c1a72fdb591fb41bbf0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757516218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/edb56b4be9b0f990b7989576f4bb2925e7b702ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757516218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/edb56b4be9b0f990b7989576f4bb2925e7b702ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757516218","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains alcohol consumption, illegal alcohol production and sales, sexual innuendo, and strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6423983393a9d69a090a01dc87c20cb7.poster.avif?t=1757516218\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6423983393a9d69a090a01dc87c20cb7.webm?t=1757516218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volstead City is rotten and dangerous. Your brother\u2014once the top bootlegger in town\u2014was arrested in a police raid. Now it\u2019s your turn to take over. As Potbellied Racoon and his men try to seize control of the city, you\u2019ll need to dodge both the cops and the criminals while uncovering the truth behind your brother\u2019s arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your brand, grow your crops, craft your booze, and meet eccentric customers across the city. Complete their quirky missions, build relationships, and grow your underground empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/d43b5594bbf496791c0633a727dfee62.poster.avif?t=1757516218\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/d43b5594bbf496791c0633a727dfee62.webm?t=1757516218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beer to hard liquors \u2014 grow your ingredients and master the machines to craft a wide variety of drinks. Ferment, distill, barrel-age, and infuse flavors to create truly unique bottles then automate it all for maximum profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e802f8aacd85dac19779abd64118a9f8.poster.avif?t=1757516218\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e802f8aacd85dac19779abd64118a9f8.webm?t=1757516218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own label, slap it on the bottle, and let the streets of Volstead know your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/5b2de72880bbebc6c6d1d724eda7f9fa.poster.avif?t=1757516218\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat